# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the asan test preset.
#
# Only leaks inside system libraries belong here, never bdex code: each
# entry names a library the engine does not control and says why.

# PipeWire, which OpenAL opens to reach the audio device on most Linux
# desktops, keeps module allocations alive past exit. CI machines have no
# audio device, so only local runs of the OpenAL test meet it.
leak:libpipewire
